Bundled Quran text and translations

quran.sh includes data from quran-json by Risan Bagja Pradana:
https://github.com/risan/quran-json

That data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

quran.sh redistributes the text without substantive textual changes. Its build
process combines the language and transliteration datasets and embeds them in
the JavaScript bundle and standalone executable. The bundled data remains
available under CC BY-SA 4.0.

